WEBVTT

00:01:25.746 --> 00:01:30.204
are the dentate gyrus,
associated with learning and memory,

00:01:30.246 --> 00:01:33.829
the subventricular zone, which may
supply neurons to the olfactory bulb

00:01:33.871 --> 00:01:36.538
for communication
between the nose and brain,

00:01:36.579 --> 00:01:40.538
and the striatum,
which helps manage movement.

00:01:40.579 --> 00:01:42.913
Scientists don’t yet have 
a good grasp on exactly

00:01:42.954 --> 00:01:45.538
what role neurogenesis plays
in any of these regions,

00:01:45.579 --> 00:01:51.329
or why they have this ability
that’s absent from the rest of the brain.

00:01:52.746 --> 00:01:56.704
But the mere presence of a mechanism
to grow new neurons in the adult brain

00:01:56.746 --> 00:01:59.871
opens up an amazing possibility.